{"text": "这顿我请你", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "今天我买单，你别跟我抢", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "走一起去吃饭吧", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "请你吃火锅怎么样", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "谢谢你啊，太贴心了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "早点睡吧，晚安好梦", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "多喝热水，注意身体", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "路上小心，到家跟我说一声", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "吃了吗你，没吃一起呀", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "没事别担心，有我呢", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "辛苦啦，快歇歇吧", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "开心就好，别想太多", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "慢慢来不急，我等你", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "改天请你喝奶茶", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "周末我做饭给你吃", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "帮你带了份早餐，记得吃", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "有啥事随时找我啊", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "好久不见，改天聚聚", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "生日快乐，礼物给你寄了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "天冷了记得加衣服", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "别跟我抢，这顿必须我买单", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "抢着付钱这事我可不让你", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "这题太难我脑子都要炸了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "作业多到爆炸，头都大了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
{"text": "笑到肚子炸了，太好玩了", "danger": false, "with_context": false, "object": "未标记", "severity": "none"}
